<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Listening review</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Listening review</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><h2>15-minute listening track</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3"></audio><p>Use with questions 1–20. Each of four groups takes 3 minutes 45 seconds. Sources play twice; silence is intentional answer time.</p><a href="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3" download>Download full MP3</a></section><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h2>L1 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-1.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L2 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-2.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L3 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-3.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L4 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-4.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Question-by-question listening review</h2><p>Short single-play clips below omit the long answer silence. Open a transcript only when reviewing.</p><div class="audio-list"><section class="box" id="C1A-M01"><h3>Question 1 · A new classmate</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m01.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">大家好，我叫王明。我今年十七岁，在明华学校上学。我哥哥十九岁，他在上海学习。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M02"><h3>Question 2 · Jobs in the family</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m02.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我家有四个人。爸爸是老师，妈妈是医生。我和弟弟都是学生。妈妈每天早上八点去医院。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M03"><h3>Question 3 · Two younger relatives</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m03.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这是我妹妹的照片，她今年十五岁，喜欢唱歌。我弟弟只有九岁，喜欢画画。我每天和妹妹一起上学。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M04"><h3>Question 4 · Where a classmate is from</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m04.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我叫李安，是韩国人。现在我在北京学中文。我们班的老师是中国人，我的好朋友是美国人。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M05"><h3>Question 5 · Meeting at school</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m05.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我是明华学校的学生。今天是星期一，我在学校门口等朋友。她是新同学，今天第一次来这里上课。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M06"><h3>Question 6 · A pencil for class</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m06.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">上课要用铅笔。你有铅笔吗？</p><p class="cn">我只有一支钢笔，没有铅笔。</p><p class="cn">你可以先用我的，我有两支铅笔。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M07"><h3>Question 7 · Borrowing a book</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m07.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你的中文书能借我看一下吗？</p><p class="cn">可以，书在桌子上。</p><p class="cn">谢谢。我的中文书在家里，英语书在书包里。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M08"><h3>Question 8 · Finding a classroom</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m08.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">老师，今天在哪儿上课？</p><p class="cn">在三楼的三零二教室，不是二楼。</p><p class="cn">好的，我现在去三楼等同学。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M09"><h3>Question 9 · After the lesson</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m09.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">下课后你去哪儿？去食堂吃饭吗？</p><p class="cn">我先去图书馆借书，然后回家。今天我不在学校吃饭。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M10"><h3>Question 10 · Today’s starting time</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m10.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天的中文课还是九点开始吗？</p><p class="cn">不是，今天九点半开始，十点半下课。</p><p class="cn">好，那我九点二十到教室。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M11"><h3>Question 11 · Lunch and dinner</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m11.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">中午吃什么？你想吃面条吗？</p><p class="cn">晚上我想吃面条。现在我想吃米饭和鸡蛋，不想吃肉。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M12"><h3>Question 12 · Three breakfast drinks</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m12.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">早上妈妈喝茶，爸爸喝咖啡。我不喝茶，也不喝咖啡。我每天喝一杯牛奶，然后去上学。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M13"><h3>Question 13 · Buying fruit</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m13.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你要几个苹果？</p><p class="cn">我要四个苹果，再要两个香蕉。</p><p class="cn">好的，四个苹果、两个香蕉，放在这个袋子里。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M14"><h3>Question 14 · The price of lunch</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m14.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这份午饭多少钱？</p><p class="cn">十二块。</p><p class="cn">给你二十块。</p><p class="cn">谢谢，找你八块。你的午饭在桌子上。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M15"><h3>Question 15 · Choosing a shirt</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m15.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你喜欢这件红色的衣服吗？</p><p class="cn">我喜欢蓝色的，不喜欢红色的。蓝色这件也不大，我就买这件吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M16"><h3>Question 16 · Choosing a day</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m16.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期六一起去看电影，好吗？</p><p class="cn">星期六我要上课。星期天下午我有时间。</p><p class="cn">好，我们星期天下午见。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M17"><h3>Question 17 · Leaving after breakfast</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m17.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你早上几点出门？</p><p class="cn">我六点半起床，七点吃早饭，七点半出门。学校很近，八点以前就能到。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M18"><h3>Question 18 · A cold morning</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m18.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天外面很冷，你穿这件衣服去学校吗？</p><p class="cn">不穿这件薄的。我穿那件厚外套。</p><p class="cn">好，别忘了你的书包。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M19"><h3>Question 19 · A shared activity</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m19.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">下午一起去打篮球吧？</p><p class="cn">我不太会打篮球。我想去公园走走，你去吗？</p><p class="cn">好，我也想去公园。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1A-M20"><h3>Question 20 · A free afternoon</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m20.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">周末你喜欢做什么？</p><p class="cn">我喜欢画画，也喜欢听音乐。这周六下午我要在家画画。星期天再去听音乐。</p></details></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Speaking prompts · S1</h2><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h3>S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你好！你叫什么名字？今年多大？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你喜欢吃什么？喜欢喝什么？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你早上几点去学校？几点上课？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期六一起去公园，好吗？你几点有空？</p></details></section></div></main></body></html>